WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:02.200
Matthew 24

00:02.200 --> 00:09.920
Jesus left the temple and was going away when his disciples came to point out to him the buildings of the temple.

00:10.480 --> 00:11.380
But he answered them,

00:12.240 --> 00:13.900
You see all these, do you not?

00:14.600 --> 00:20.700
Truly I say to you, there will not be left here one stone upon another that will not be thrown down.

00:21.460 --> 00:25.980
As he sat on the Mount of Olives, the disciples came to him privately, saying,

00:25.980 --> 00:29.020
Tell us, when will these things be?

00:29.480 --> 00:33.020
And what will be the sign of your coming and of the close of the age?

00:33.600 --> 00:35.040
And Jesus answered them,

00:35.680 --> 00:37.860
See that no one leads you astray.

00:38.340 --> 00:41.560
For many will come in my name, saying, I am the Christ.

00:41.740 --> 00:43.480
And they will lead many astray.

00:44.060 --> 00:46.740
And you will hear of wars and rumors of wars.

00:47.300 --> 00:48.700
See that you are not alarmed.

00:49.180 --> 00:52.380
For this must take place, but the end is not yet.

00:53.160 --> 00:55.720
For nation will rise against nation.

00:55.980 --> 00:57.340
And kingdom against kingdom.

00:57.820 --> 01:00.980
And there will be famines and earthquakes in various places.

01:01.760 --> 01:05.040
All these are but the beginning of the birth pains.

01:06.420 --> 01:10.680
Then they will deliver you up to tribulation and put you to death.

01:10.960 --> 01:13.900
And you will be hated by all nations for my name's sake.

01:15.080 --> 01:19.580
And then many will fall away and betray one another and hate one another.

01:19.980 --> 01:23.400
And many false prophets will arise and lead many astray.

01:24.080 --> 01:25.840
And because lawlessness will be encouraged,

01:25.980 --> 01:29.300
Christ, the love of many will grow cold.

01:30.440 --> 01:33.380
But the one who endures to the end will be saved.

01:34.100 --> 01:38.240
And this gospel of the kingdom will be proclaimed throughout the whole world

01:38.240 --> 01:40.620
as a testimony to all nations.

01:41.360 --> 01:43.240
And then the end will come.

01:44.560 --> 01:49.480
So when you see the abomination of desolation spoken of by the prophet Daniel

01:49.480 --> 01:51.460
standing in the holy place,

01:51.920 --> 01:53.260
let the reader understand.

01:53.820 --> 01:55.960
Then let those who are in Judea,

01:55.980 --> 01:57.060
flee to the mountains.

01:57.800 --> 02:02.100
Let the one who is on the housetop not go down to take what is in his house.

02:02.640 --> 02:06.720
And let the one who is in the field not turn back to take his cloak.

02:07.600 --> 02:12.840
And alas for women who are pregnant and for those who are nursing infants in those days.

02:13.660 --> 02:16.820
Pray that your flight may not be in winter or on a Sabbath.

02:17.760 --> 02:20.020
For then there will be great tribulation,

02:20.500 --> 02:24.000
such as has not been from the beginning of the world until now.

02:24.380 --> 02:24.980
No.

02:25.340 --> 02:25.960
And never.

02:25.980 --> 02:26.640
Never will be.

02:27.520 --> 02:30.160
And if those days had not been cut short,

02:30.460 --> 02:32.460
no human being would be saved.

02:32.940 --> 02:36.240
But for the sake of the elect those days will be cut short.

02:37.040 --> 02:38.420
Then if anyone says to you,

02:38.760 --> 02:41.680
Look, here is the Christ, or there he is,

02:42.500 --> 02:43.680
do not believe it.

02:44.340 --> 02:47.440
For false Christs and false prophets will arise

02:47.440 --> 02:49.680
and perform great signs and wonders,

02:50.080 --> 02:53.360
so as to lead astray, if possible, even the elect.

02:54.260 --> 02:55.960
See, I have told you before,

02:55.980 --> 02:58.400
So, if they say to you,

02:58.700 --> 02:59.920
Look, he is in the wilderness,

03:00.500 --> 03:01.460
do not go out.

03:02.100 --> 03:02.980
If they say,

03:03.320 --> 03:04.880
Look, he is in the inner rooms,

03:05.260 --> 03:06.440
do not believe it.

03:07.340 --> 03:11.920
For as the lightning comes from the east and shines as far as the west,

03:12.460 --> 03:15.080
so will be the coming of the Son of Man.

03:16.080 --> 03:17.520
Wherever the corpse is,

03:17.860 --> 03:19.500
there the vultures will gather.

03:21.060 --> 03:24.020
Immediately after the tribulation of those days,

03:24.020 --> 03:25.900
the sun will be darkened,

03:25.980 --> 03:27.860
and the moon will not give its light,

03:28.200 --> 03:30.200
and the stars will fall from heaven,

03:30.340 --> 03:32.520
and the powers of the heavens will be shaken.

03:33.840 --> 03:37.120
Then will appear in heaven the sign of the Son of Man,

03:37.340 --> 03:40.740
and then all the tribes of the earth will mourn,

03:40.740 --> 03:44.600
and they will see the Son of Man coming on the clouds of heaven

03:44.600 --> 03:46.880
with power and great glory.

03:47.960 --> 03:51.620
And he will send out his angels with a loud trumpet call,

03:51.940 --> 03:54.800
and they will gather his elect from the four winds,

03:55.240 --> 03:55.740
from one end,

03:55.980 --> 03:57.580
from one end of heaven to the other.

03:58.900 --> 04:01.160
From the fig tree learn its lesson.

04:01.780 --> 04:04.940
As soon as its branch becomes tender and puts out its leaves,

04:05.420 --> 04:06.920
you know that summer is near.

04:07.540 --> 04:09.920
So also when you see all these things,

04:10.320 --> 04:11.740
you know that he is near,

04:12.280 --> 04:13.480
at the very gates.

04:14.520 --> 04:15.740
Truly I say to you,

04:16.160 --> 04:18.300
this generation will not pass away

04:18.300 --> 04:20.860
until all these things take place.

04:21.460 --> 04:23.060
Heaven and earth will pass away,

04:23.620 --> 04:25.960
but my words will not pass away.

04:26.700 --> 04:29.020
But concerning that day and hour,

04:29.140 --> 04:29.940
no one knows,

04:30.440 --> 04:32.140
not even the angels of heaven,

04:32.520 --> 04:33.400
nor the Son,

04:34.260 --> 04:35.840
but the Father only.

04:37.180 --> 04:38.820
For as were the days of Noah,

04:38.980 --> 04:41.460
so will be the coming of the Son of Man.

04:42.140 --> 04:44.260
For as in those days before the flood,

04:44.600 --> 04:46.000
they were eating and drinking,

04:46.260 --> 04:47.660
marrying and giving in marriage,

04:48.020 --> 04:50.400
until the day when Noah entered the ark.

04:51.080 --> 04:53.800
And they were unaware until the flood came

04:53.800 --> 04:55.160
and swept them all away.

04:55.980 --> 04:58.500
So will be the coming of the Son of Man.

04:59.120 --> 05:00.960
Then two men will be in the field,

05:01.280 --> 05:03.460
one will be taken and one left.

05:03.820 --> 05:05.700
Two women will be grinding at the mill,

05:06.060 --> 05:08.880
one will be taken and one left.

05:10.320 --> 05:12.240
Therefore stay awake,

05:12.660 --> 05:15.420
for you do not know on what day your Lord is coming.

05:16.080 --> 05:17.120
But know this,

05:17.480 --> 05:19.600
that if the master of the house had known

05:19.600 --> 05:21.680
in what part of the night the thief was coming,

05:22.160 --> 05:23.420
he would have stayed awake

05:23.420 --> 05:25.720
and would not have let his house be broken into.

05:25.720 --> 05:25.960
Therefore stay awake,

05:25.960 --> 05:29.060
therefore you also must be ready,

05:29.620 --> 05:30.980
for the Son of Man is coming

05:30.980 --> 05:33.000
at an hour you do not expect.

05:34.300 --> 05:36.800
Who then is the faithful and wise servant

05:36.800 --> 05:39.340
whom his master has set over his household

05:39.340 --> 05:42.080
to give them their food at the proper time?

05:42.960 --> 05:44.260
Blessed is that servant

05:44.260 --> 05:47.100
whom his master will find so doing when he comes.

05:48.400 --> 05:49.600
Truly I say to you,

05:49.980 --> 05:51.980
he will set him over all his possessions.

05:52.900 --> 05:55.780
But if that wicked servant says to himself,

05:55.960 --> 05:57.680
My master is delayed

05:57.680 --> 06:00.380
and begins to beat his fellow servants

06:00.380 --> 06:02.940
and eats and drinks with drunkards,

06:03.600 --> 06:06.160
the master of that servant will come on a day

06:06.160 --> 06:07.840
when he does not expect him

06:07.840 --> 06:10.120
and at an hour he does not know

06:10.120 --> 06:12.340
and will cut him in pieces

06:12.340 --> 06:13.880
and put him with the hypocrites.

06:14.560 --> 06:16.620
In that place there will be weeping

06:16.620 --> 06:18.100
and gnashing of teeth.

